1 (B) smell the uppercase Roses +flowers @outside
TODO: 1 deleted.
-- d2.want --

-- d2err.want --
TODO: No tasks were deleted.
-- d3.want --

1 (B) smell the uppercase Roses +flowers @outside
TODO: 1 deleted.
-- d4.want --
4 A new task
TODO: 4 added.
-- d5.want --
2 (A) notice the sunflowers
TODO: 2 deleted.
-- d6.want --
3 Another new task
TODO: 3 added.
-- d7.want --
stop
A new task
Another new task
