1 (B) smell the Roses +flowers @outside
-- t2.want --
1 (B) smell the Roses +flowers @outside
TODO: Removed 'the Roses' from task.
1 (B) smell +flowers @outside
-- t3.want --
1 (B) smell +flowers @outside
TODO: Removed 'm' from task.
1 (B) sell +flowers @outside
-- t4.want --
1 (B) sell +flowers @outside
TODO: Removed '@outside' from task.
